msgid "Hello, sir. Are you looking for anything in particular?"
msgstr "Salve, signore. Cerca qualcosa in particolare?"

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Will that be all for you, sir?"
msgstr "È tutto, signore?"

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "No, I'm not done yet."
msgstr "No, non ho ancora finito."

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "All right. Might I ask what you're looking for?"
msgstr "Perfetto. Le potrei chiedere cosa desidera?"

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "We hope to see you again soon."
msgstr "Speriamo di rivederla presto."

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Yeah, I'm done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "Very well, sir. Let me walk you to the door."
msgstr "Molto bene, signore. La accompagno alla porta."

msgctxt "1316"
msgid ""
"Thank you for shopping with us. Pardon me, sir, but you wouldn't happen to "
"be looking for any foreign brands, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "Come mai lo chiedi?"

msgctxt "1340"
msgid ""
"Well, every two months, we travel to Europe to purchase name-brand goods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"If you make a reservation with us for certain foreign brands, we will "
"purchase them for you in Europe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"They've got lots of fancy handbags over there that you can't get over here "
"in Japan, so if you're hoping to get your hands on one, just let us know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"(You can make special reservations for the fanciest European brands, huh? I "
"should remember this when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "Yeah, that's it."
msgstr "Sì, esatto."

msgctxt "1412"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "Non ancora."

